{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>ViuTV遊戲節目《輪盤遊戲》第4集將傢俬店變成大型躲藏戰場，8位玩家為避過獵人追捕各出奇謀。向來以甜美形象示人的Chloe So今次更完全放下偶像包袱，將整張臉塗成灰色融入環境，破格造型不但令眾人幾乎認不出，更把吳肇軒嚇得當場失聲大叫。</p>\n<h2>《輪盤遊戲》傢俬店爆發躲藏戰ChloeSo灰臉現身</h2>\n<p>第4集節目安排8位玩家在傢俬店內進行躲避搜索挑戰，規則限制獵人必須在20分鐘內找出所有人。節目組耗費心思佈置場地並準備大量道具，而與193分在同一組參賽者Chloe So為求隱蔽不惜犧牲色相。她將整塊面塗成毫無血色全灰狀態，完美融入背景佈置之中，當她以這副灰臉姿態現身時，瞬間嚇壞在場所有成員，吳肇軒更當場嚇到失聲大叫。</p>\n<h2>製作組大讚參賽者投入程度ChloeSo放下包袱</h2>\n<p>節目製作組對眾人投入程度給予極高評價，直指大家完全將形象拋諸腦後。同隊成員193原本因為身高問題打算偽裝成攝影師，卻遭到Chloe So與Jason當面嫌棄。現場工作人員透露Chloe So這次化妝改造毫不介意，完全符合製作組期望玩家「為咗贏不惜一切」精神。她展現出極強勝負慾與專業態度，徹底顛覆以往甜美斯文既定印象，與Jason化身床褥及Alton裝扮成盆栽一同成為全場焦點。</p>\n<h2>Chloe So破格演出洗脫花瓶標籤昔日清純形象大反轉</h2>\n<p>過去Chloe So活躍於影視圈及模特兒界，大多以清純可愛形象示人，甚少在綜藝節目中展露瘋狂一面。這次參與由邱士縉及吳肇軒等主持陣容帶領節目，她大膽挑戰極限並放下偶像身段，向觀眾展現真實性格。同場其他玩家亦各出奇謀，例如Alton匿藏至睡著，Jason更費盡心思把自己變成一張床褥，最終獵人郭嘉駿在20分鐘內僅成功找到3人而宣告挑戰失敗。</p>\n<h2>網民熱議破天荒灰臉造型激讚女星展現專業精神</h2>\n<p>節目播出後隨即在各大網上論壇引發熱烈討論，不少觀眾對這場躲藏戰感到驚喜。大批網民湧入社交平台留言支持，有觀眾留言表示「Chloe So灰面真係好癲」、「完全認唔出係佢」，亦有人讚賞她具備綜藝天份。粉絲群組內紛紛討論她與193互動火花，並留言「估唔到女明星可以咁放」，大量截圖在網絡上瘋傳，令這場極致隱蔽挑戰成為全城熱話。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179577380676381270_11906888306b09556f705a8.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ed9a9815-7bbc-4915-964d-b3b9a35c0467.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179577380676381270_11906888306b09556f705a8.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179577381564876864_11245522656b0955781cdc9.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"474aaf9a-4b72-4a6f-8aa3-50fdee6fcf65.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179577381564876864_11245522656b0955781cdc9.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179577382324155266_15851708946b09557fcefe5.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0a3c3e99-2fac-47db-b306-0c1745a14673.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179577382324155266_15851708946b09557fcefe5.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179577383125684506_8718686726b095587d98f0.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"4658a5fc-3d83-4ea0-b4d1-51d8b194dfe8.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179577383125684506_8718686726b095587d98f0.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179577383979683637_20600144906b09559086a43.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Screenshot 2026-11-27 at 18.40.53.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179577383979683637_20600144906b09559086a43.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179577384707944437_13998355296b095597bbc9c.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6be3f5df-74ba-4d91-bec8-3d936d27bd8f.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179577384707944437_13998355296b095597bbc9c.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T14:50:27.932292+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1193,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T14:30:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T15:37:29.687274+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T14:43:55.705139+00:00","content_hash":"5ad45126e950fd05c54913da8a9caddcf8a0126e82f6aec9353e614e0922a64d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}